      "text": "1. Start, connect to MQTT\n2. Register with producer (platform info)\n3. Receive test assignment\n4. For each test:\n   → Find matching handler (pattern)\n   → Execute handler.execute()\n   → Validate with expectation\n   → Report result to producer\n5. Signal done, exit",
